[Debug] ----- Vuln Cause Analysis -----
The potential vulnerability is related to a Directory Traversal vulnerability. This vulnerability arises because the API allows users to specify a filename for song retrieval without adequate validation or restrictions on the input. If the filename is not properly sanitized, an attacker could manipulate the input to access files outside the intended directory (e.g., `/var/songs`), potentially exposing sensitive files on the server. This occurs when the application directly uses user-supplied input to construct file paths, leading to unauthorized access to the filesystem.

